Description:
New York. Congregation Ahawath Chesed. Order of Service for the Consecration of the Temple Ahawath Chesed, Cor. Lexington Ave. & 55th St., on Friday, April 19th, 1872. New-York: L. H. Frank & Co., Printers, 1872. 10, [1] p.

Consecration sermons are by A. Huebsch (in German) and J. K. Gutheim (in English);

Copies: NNJ, OCH.
